message: "If you use this software or workshop material, please cite it as below."
title: "Point Cloud Classification Under Distribution Shift: Partial Views, Missing Points and Real Scans"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Md. Mazharul Islam"
    family-names: "Akayed"
    affiliation: "Shanghai University of Engineering Science"
repository-code: "https://github.com/akayedackerman/cad-to-scan-pointmlp"
url: "https://github.com/akayedackerman/cad-to-scan-pointmlp"
abstract: >-
  Workshop project on 3D point cloud classification with PointMLP trained on ModelNet40 and
  tested under distribution shift: single-view partial clouds (Hidden Point Removal), random
  point removal and ScanObjectNN real scans, with zero-shot CLIP and test-time adaptation.
keywords:
  - point cloud classification
  - PointMLP
  - ModelNet40
  - ScanObjectNN
  - distribution shift
  - test-time adaptation
